    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>CodeReactors</strong> is a roguelike action RPG where the young sorceress Himari explores a world created by the Five Witches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Her encounter with the demon girl Eve sets off a chain of events surrounding the \u201cPrimordial Magic.\u201d Each dungeon is randomly generated on entry\u2014gather spells and relics to gain the upper hand in your adventure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Choose your Cards to form the strongest Magic Combo!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171640/extras/cd7a11b6936f6e0a5178b24b594e76cf.avif?t=1751103089\" data-has-big /></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In addition to thrilling regular attacks, evasions, and parry abilities, you can use Spell Cards and unleash the magic locked within them to attack. Spell Cards can be executed in the order added to your Deck with the touch of a button. Leverage each Card's special traits to battle with your own unique Magic Combo!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore thrilling roguelike Dungeons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171640/extras/fe68c6d2710243bb53fefd68c3d44135.avif?t=1751103089\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore Maze Dungeons rearranged each time you enter and collect powerful Cards and Relics. Your judgment and battle skills will be put to the test with each Card you choose! Defeat the boss at the Maze's deepest depths to advance through the story.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Streaming Guidelines</h2>We welcome gameplay streaming and video uploads of CodeReactors, whether by individuals or organizations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Monetization is also allowed. Your support and content help empower our development team.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>CodeReactors</strong> is a roguelike action RPG where the young sorceress Himari explores a world created by the Five Witches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Her encounter with the demon girl Eve sets off a chain of events surrounding the \u201cPrimordial Magic.\u201d Each dungeon is randomly generated on entry\u2014gather spells and relics to gain the upper hand in your adventure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Choose your Cards to form the strongest Magic Combo!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171640/extras/cd7a11b6936f6e0a5178b24b594e76cf.avif?t=1751103089\" data-has-big /></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In addition to thrilling regular attacks, evasions, and parry abilities, you can use Spell Cards and unleash the magic locked within them to attack. Spell Cards can be executed in the order added to your Deck with the touch of a button. Leverage each Card's special traits to battle with your own unique Magic Combo!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore thrilling roguelike Dungeons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171640/extras/fe68c6d2710243bb53fefd68c3d44135.avif?t=1751103089\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore Maze Dungeons rearranged each time you enter and collect powerful Cards and Relics. Your judgment and battle skills will be put to the test with each Card you choose! Defeat the boss at the Maze's deepest depths to advance through the story.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Streaming Guidelines</h2>We welcome gameplay streaming and video uploads of CodeReactors, whether by individuals or organizations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Monetization is also allowed. Your support and content help empower our development team.</p>",
